{"command": "cd /testbed && python3 -c \"\nimport inspect, sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'src')\nfrom cachetools import LRUCache, Cache\n# Print LRUCache methods\nprint('=== LRUCache methods ===')\nfor name in dir(LRUCache):\n    if not name.startswith('_') or name in ('__getitem__', '__setitem__', '__delitem__', '__len__', '__contains__', '__init__', '__repr__', '__eq__', '__hash__'):\n        print(f'  {name}')\nprint()\nprint('=== LRUCache.__init__ signature ===')\nprint(inspect.signature(LRUCache.__init__))\nprint()\nprint('=== Cache.__init__ signature ===')\nprint(inspect.signature(Cache.__init__))\nprint()\n# Check if LRUCache has __update\nprint('=== LRUCache source snippets ===')\nprint(inspect.getsource(LRUCache.__getitem__))\nprint('---')\nprint(inspect.getsource(LRUCache.__setitem__))\nprint('---')\nprint(inspect.getsource(LRUCache.__delitem__))\nprint('---')\nprint(inspect.getsource(LRUCache.popitem))\n\"", "exit_code": 0, "stderr": "", "stdout": "=== LRUCache methods ===\n  __contains__\n  __delitem__\n  __eq__\n  __getitem__\n  __hash__\n  __init__\n  __len__\n  __repr__\n  __setitem__\n  clear\n  currsize\n  get\n  getsizeof\n  items\n  keys\n  maxsize\n  pop\n  popitem\n  setdefault\n  update\n  values\n\n=== LRUCache.__init__ signature ===\n(self, maxsize, getsizeof=None)\n\n=== Cache.__init__ signature ===\n(self, maxsize, getsizeof=None)\n\n=== LRUCache source snippets ===\n    def __getitem__(self, key, cache_getitem=Cache.__getitem__):\n        value = cache_getitem(self, key)\n        if key in self:  # __missing__ may not store item\n            self.__update(key)\n        return value\n\n---\n    def __setitem__(self, key, value, cache_setitem=Cache.__setitem__):\n        cache_setitem(self, key, value)\n        self.__update(key)\n\n---\n    def __delitem__(self, key, cache_delitem=Cache.__delitem__):\n        cache_delitem(self, key)\n        del self.__order[key]\n\n---\n    def popitem(self):\n        \"\"\"Remove and return the `(key, value)` pair least recently used.\"\"\"\n        try:\n            key = next(iter(self.__order))\n        except StopIteration:\n            raise KeyError(\"%s is empty\" % type(self).__name__) from None\n        else:\n            return (key, self.pop(key))\n\n"}